// Body tissues are materials of the species (plan §2.10). All values are estimates, tuned so that flesh cuts easily
// and bone is the hard part (bone IY/IF 0.2 and SF 0.13 follow the Material science table).
// Resolver v2 fields (resolver-v2 3.2, anatomy 3.4): cut_resist_pm and crush_resist_pm multiply a layer's edged and blunt needs
// (bone 2500 and 5000: rule C2, bone is a real stop), blunt_absorb_pm is the share of momentum a crushed layer soaks up
// (skin 20, fat 80, muscle 120), pain_pm the pain multiplier for wounds in the tissue.
